{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, then move to object and grab it. If heavy, call for help. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObj    /> <Action ID = GrabObj    /> <Action ID = IsObjLightweight    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CallForHelp    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
